15 endpoint في 6 مجموعات:

✅ Auth      → register, login
✅ Devices   → create, list, revoke
✅ Keys      → register, list, revoke
Revokes one organization-scoped key without deleting the whole device.
✅ Delegates → add, list, delete
✅ Sessions  → create, verify, status, cancel
🔲 Org       → link-user, bind-device

